{#- THE TAB ICON AND THE HOME-SCREEN ICONS, on every page (brand/README.md §3,
    favicon/head-snippet.html). The tab icon is the FRAME symbol (Chase,
    2026-10-13: "I want to try the thauma-symbol-frame-white.svg as the
    favicon to start"), white in a dark browser and black in a light one so
    it never disappears into the tab bar. Files at the site root: src/favicon/.

    TWO APPS ON ONE ADDRESS (docs/APP-PLAN.md): the public site installs as
    "Thauma" (the rounded symbol, site.webmanifest) and the console as
    "Console" (the frame symbol, console.webmanifest). A console layout sets
    consoleApp before including this. -#}
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="48x48">
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
{%- if consoleApp %}
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/console-apple-touch-icon.png">
<link rel="manifest" href="/console.webmanifest">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Console">
{%- else %}
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">
<link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Thauma">
{%- endif %}
<meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black">
<meta name="theme-color" content="{{ themeColor or '#0B0F15' }}">
